  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Grocery_Store?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7e/Grocery_Store.png/revision/latest?cb=20250926034449\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Grocery Store\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"186\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service Building</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>rep</span><span title=\"Reputation point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"rep\"><img alt=\"rep\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/1c/Reputation.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141647\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Rep. lvl(s) 1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 500</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>grocery store</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">service building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">reputation</a> level 1 in the player's <a href=\"/wiki/town-13129\" title=\"Town\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town</a>.\n</p><p>It is the first service building to be unlocked in the town.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The appearance of the grocery store changes as the player upgrades it:\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGrocery_Store_Stage_1.png\" title=\"Grocery Store Stage 1.png (475 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/8e/Grocery_Store_Stage_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713213815\" title=\"Grocery Store Stage 1.png (475 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Grocery Store Stage 1.png (475 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGrocery_Store_Inside_1.png\" title=\"Grocery Store Inside 1.png (353 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5d/Grocery_Store_Inside_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713213816\" title=\"Grocery Store Inside 1.png (353 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Grocery Store Inside 1.png (353 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGrocery_Store_Stage_2.png\" title=\"Grocery Store Stage 2.png (481 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/80/Grocery_Store_Stage_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713213816\" title=\"Grocery Store Stage 2.png (481 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Grocery Store Stage 2.png (481 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGrocery_Store_Inside_2.png\" title=\"Grocery Store Inside 2.png (360 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Grocery_Store_Inside_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713213816\" title=\"Grocery Store Inside 2.png (360 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Grocery Store Inside 2.png (360 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGrocery_Store.png\" title=\"Grocery Store.png (465 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7e/Grocery_Store.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250926034449\" title=\"Grocery Store.png (465 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Grocery Store.png (465 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AGrocery_Store_Inside.png\" title=\"Grocery Store Inside.png (376 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/8c/Grocery_Store_Inside.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713213245\" title=\"Grocery Store Inside.png (376 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Grocery Store Inside.png (376 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>The grocery store costs 500 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and takes 14 seconds (or 1 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>) to build.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Serving</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>When the grocery store is at level 1, it takes 1 hour (or&#160;? <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>) to serve a customer and 4 <span>Reputation</span><span title=\"Reputation point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Reputation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> are awarded.</li>\n<li>Serving time can be reduced to 36 minutes at most.</li>\n<li>Points can be increased to a maximum of 7&#160;<span>Reputation</span><span title=\"Reputation point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Reputation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> per customer.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p>The following materials are required to upgrade the grocery store:\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ABolt.png\" title=\"Bolt.png (21 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/8e/Bolt.png/revision/latest?cb=20180211180351\" title=\"Bolt.png (21 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Bolt\" height=\"129\" width=\"129\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Bolt.png (21 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Bolt\" height=\"129\" width=\"129\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/bolt-3342\" title=\"Bolt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bolt</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ADuct_Tape.png\" title=\"Duct Tape.png (49 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4e/Duct_Tape.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028130855\" title=\"Duct Tape.png (49 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Duct tape\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duct Tape.png (49 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Duct tape\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/duct-tape-2920\" title=\"Duct Tape\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Duct tape</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AStone_Block.png\" title=\"Stone Block.png (48 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/37/Stone_Block.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028131613\" title=\"Stone Block.png (48 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Stone block\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Stone Block.png (48 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Stone block\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/stone-block-13229\" title=\"Stone Block\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Stone block</a></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Orders</b></span></h3>\n<p>Customers visiting the grocery store usually require:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Crops</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal Goods</a></li>\n<li>And products from the:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/bakery-3545\" title=\"Bakery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bakery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/dairy-3547\" title=\"Dairy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dairy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/jam-maker-3561\" title=\"Jam Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Jam Maker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/pasta-maker-19438\" title=\"Pasta Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pasta Maker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/sugar-mill-3550\" title=\"Sugar Mill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sugar Mill</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/sauce-maker-8894\" title=\"Sauce Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sauce Maker</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/bolt-3342\" title=\"Bolt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bolts</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/duct-tape-2920\" title=\"Duct Tape\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">duct tape</a> are also used to upgrade the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Barn</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/stone-block-13229\" title=\"Stone Block\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Stone blocks</a> are also used to upgrade the <a href=\"/wiki/gift-shop-15760\" title=\"Gift Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gift Shop</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/spa-13195\" title=\"Spa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spa</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/town-hall-13238\" title=\"Town Hall\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Town Hall</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/beach-caf%C3%A9-13311\" title=\"Beach Café (6.74 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/bf/Beach_Caf%C3%A9.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219113615\" title=\"Beach Café (6.74 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Beach Café (6.74 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/bed-and-breakfast-13194\" title=\"Bed and Breakfast (6.47 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/88/Bed_and_Breakfast.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219113856\" title=\"Bed and Breakfast (6.47 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Bed and Breakfast (6.47 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/cinema-13193\" title=\"Cinema (6.37 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/39/Cinema.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219113957\" title=\"Cinema (6.37 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cinema (6.37 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/diner-13192\" title=\"Diner (6.52 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/19/Diner.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219114114\" title=\"Diner (6.52 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Diner (6.52 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/gift-shop-15760\" title=\"Gift Shop (859 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5b/Gift_Shop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713204537\" title=\"Gift Shop (859 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Gift Shop (859 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/grocery-store-13191\" title=\"Grocery Store (465 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7e/Grocery_Store.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250926034449\" title=\"Grocery Store (465 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Grocery Store (465 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/spa-13195\" title=\"Spa (7.83 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/eb/Spa.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219114322\" title=\"Spa (7