  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Grocery Store.png|200px|left]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Service Buildings|Service Building]]\n |rlevel = 1\n |price = 500\n}}\nThe '''grocery store''' is a [[Service Buildings|service building]] unlocked at [[reputation]] level 1 in the player's [[town]].\n\nIt is the first service building to be unlocked in the town.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n=== '''Appearance''' ===\nThe appearance of the grocery store changes as the player upgrades it:\n<gallery>\nGrocery Store Stage 1.png\nGrocery Store Inside 1.png\nGrocery Store Stage 2.png\nGrocery Store Inside 2.png\nGrocery Store.png\nGrocery Store Inside.png\n</gallery>\n----\n=== '''Building''' ===\nThe grocery store costs 500 {{Infoicon|coin}} and takes 14 seconds (or 1 [[diamond]]s) to build.\n----\n=== '''Serving''' ===\n* When the grocery store is at level 1, it takes 1 hour (or ? [[diamond]]s) to serve a customer and 4 {{Infoicon|rep|link=Reputation}} are awarded.\n* Serving time can be reduced to 36 minutes at most.\n* Points can be increased to a maximum of 7 {{Infoicon|rep|link=Reputation}} per customer.\n----\n=== '''Upgrading''' ===\n{{Main|Service Buildings}}\nThe following materials are required to upgrade the grocery store:\n<gallery>\nBolt.png|[[Bolt]]\nDuct Tape.png|[[Duct Tape|Duct tape]]\nStone Block.png|[[Stone Block|Stone block]]\n</gallery>\n----\n=== '''Orders''' ===\nCustomers visiting the grocery store usually require:\n*[[Crops]]\n*[[Animal Goods]]\n*And products from the:\n**[[Bakery]]\n**[[Dairy]]\n**[[Jam Maker]]\n**[[Pasta Maker]]\n**[[Sugar Mill]]\n**[[Sauce Maker]]\n----\n=== '''Strategy tips''' ===\n* [[Bolt]]s and [[Duct Tape|duct tape]] are also used to upgrade the [[Barn]].\n* [[Stone Block|Stone blocks]] are also used to upgrade the [[Gift Shop]], the [[Spa]] and the [[Town Hall]].\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Lebensmittelgeschäft\n|es = Supermercado\n|fr = Épicerie\n|it = Negozio Di Alimentari\n}}\n[[Category:Service Buildings]]",
  "wikitextHash": "e5efeb1879d61832ddcbd3ac045e332838a5689815a6a871a8a1e28c8ea8d830"
